# Source is stored and checked out with LF everywhere.
#
# Without this, a Windows runner checks out CRLF and `cargo fmt --check` fails
# on `newline_style = "Unix"` — which is exactly how CI broke. Normalising in
# git rather than relaxing the formatter keeps one answer for what a line
# ending is, on every machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.node binary
